			"notes": "For **Minecraft Java Edition 26.3** with **Fabric Loader 0.20.1+** and **Fabric API**.\n\n## Install\n\n1. Install [Fabric Loader](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/) for 26.3 and put [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) in your `mods` folder.\n2. Download `memorypalace-1.1.0.jar` below and put it in the `mods` folder too.\n3. Optional look: **Options → Resource Packs → Memory Palace: Clean white** (built into the mod) for white pages and a sans-serif font.\n\n`memory-palace-decrypt-1.1.0.jar` is the optional offline tool for encrypted notes and backups (Java 25).\n\n## What's new\n\n**Writing like Notion**\n- Type `/` in the editor for a menu of blocks: headings, lists, to-dos, quotes, code, math, tables, dividers, links, today's date, pictures, PDFs and templates.\n- `Enter` continues lists, `Tab` nests them, `Ctrl+B` / `I` / `E` / `Shift+E` / `K` for bold, italic, code, math and links.\n- The typing area, headers and menus use Computer Modern (the LaTeX font) too.\n\n**Pictures and PDFs**\n- Drag files onto the book, paste a screenshot with `Ctrl+V`, or use `/image` and `/pdf`. Every PDF page becomes a picture in the note; the PDF is kept beside it.\n- Click any picture to see it full screen.\n\n**Study tools**\n- Tick to-dos while reading, ☰ outline of headings, `#tags` (search with `J` or `/palace tags`).\n- `/template` lecture templates, per class from `Templates` folders.\n- Flashcards: write `Question :: Answer`, review with **Review** or `/palace review` (spaced repetition).\n- Save any note as a **PDF** (A4, Computer Modern, formulas and pictures).\n- Write in a **book and quill on a lectern** with the full editor.\n\n**Library**\n- `/palace library ENGG1101 MATH1851 …` builds one room per class and stocks the shelves; `/palace shelve`, `/palace index`.\n- Hand-written books with Markdown or LaTeX open in the note reader.\n\n**Themes**\n- Books can be restyled by resource packs (`assets/memorypalace/book_theme.json`); see the README.\n\nSee the [changelog](https://github.com/shauryajain07/memory-palace/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) for details.\n\nBased on [congyuemao/memory-palace](https://github.com/congyuemao/memory-palace). MIT License."
